<view class="page stagger">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="card__head">
      <text class="card__title">扫码登录</text>
      <text class="card__sub mono">{{uid}}</text>
    </view>

    <view class="qrbox">
      <image wx:if="{{qrSrc}}" class="qr" src="{{qrSrc}}" mode="aspectFit" show-menu-by-longpress />
      <view wx:else class="qr qr--ph">
        <view wx:if="{{err}}" class="qr__err">{{err}}</view>
        <view wx:else class="qr__wait">{{msg || '二维码生成中…'}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="statusbar">
      <text class="badge {{status === 'success' ? 'badge--ok' : (status === 'error' || status === 'expired' ? 'badge--danger' : 'badge--primary')}}">
        {{statusText}}
      </text>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{needVerify}}" class="verify">
      <view class="verify__hint">扫码已受理，抖音要求短信二次验证。请填写手机收到的验证码：</view>
      <input class="verify__inp" type="number" maxlength="8" placeholder="请输入短信验证码"
             value="{{code}}" bindinput="onCodeInput" disabled="{{submitting}}" />
      <button class="btn btn--primary btn--block" bindtap="submitCode" loading="{{submitting}}">提交验证码</button>
    </view>

    <view class="steps">
      <view class="step">1. 打开手机抖音 App，右上角「扫一扫」</view>
      <view class="step">2. 扫描上方二维码并确认登录</view>
      <view class="step">3. 页面会自动检测到登录成功</view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{err}}" class="errbox">{{err}}</view>

    <button class="btn btn--primary btn--block" bindtap="retry" loading="{{starting}}">重新获取二维码</button>
  </view>

  <view class="tipcard">
    服务器 IP 有时会被抖音风控。如果一直加载不出二维码，或扫码后总被要求二次验证，改用「短信登录」或导入 cookie。
  </view>
</view>
